<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>{{ date }} 시장 마감 브리프</title>
<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: "KoPubDotum";
    font-weight: 700;
    src: url(data:font/woff2;base64,{{ font_bold }}) format("woff2");
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: "KoPubDotum";
    font-weight: 300;
    src: url(data:font/woff2;base64,{{ font_light }}) format("woff2");
  }

  @page { size: A4; margin: 9mm 10mm; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  :root {
    --hy-deep: #2D2864;      /* 한양증권 CI 워드마크 색 */
    --hy-mid: #754BE4;       /* 한양증권 CI 그라데이션 중간색 */
    --hy-light: #AB7CFB;     /* 한양증권 CI 그라데이션 밝은색 */
    --hy-tint: #F5F3FA;      /* 옅은 배경 */
    --hy-tint-line: #E2DBF2;
    --ink: #1B1626;
    --ink-soft: #58536A;
    --ink-faint: #8F8A9E;
    --paper: #ffffff;
    --up: #D6273C;
    --down: #1D4ED8;
    --heat-up-3: #C81E2C; --heat-up-3-fg: #fff;
    --heat-up-2: #E2495A; --heat-up-2-fg: #fff;
    --heat-up-1: #F4B7BE; --heat-up-1-fg: #6b1420;
    --heat-flat: #E9E6EF; --heat-flat-fg: var(--ink-soft);
    --heat-down-1: #B7C9F6; --heat-down-1-fg: #16306e;
    --heat-down-2: #5C87E8; --heat-down-2-fg: #fff;
    --heat-down-3: #1D4ED8; --heat-down-3-fg: #fff;
  }

  body {
    font-family: "KoPubDotum", "Malgun Gothic", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans KR", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 0 16px 0;
    line-height: 1.48;
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }
  b, strong { font-weight: 700; }

  .masthead {
    padding: 7px 24px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--hy-deep);
  }
  .masthead img { height: 20px; display: block; }
  .masthead .wrap-label { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .page { padding: 10px 24px 0 24px; }

  .eyebrow-tag {
    display: inline-block; background: var(--hy-deep); color: #fff;
    font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    padding: 2px 8px; margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .title-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 20px; }
  .title-main h1 { margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: -0.2px; line-height: 1.35; }
  .title-main .subtitle { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .byline-box {
    flex: none; width: 180px; border: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line);
    padding: 7px 9px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .byline-box .who { font-weight: 700; color: var(--hy-deep); font-size: 11.5px; }
  .byline-box .author { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }

  h2 {
    font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin: 14px 0 6px 0;
  }
  h2 .h2-note { font-weight: 300; font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); float: right; }

  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 11.5px; }
  table.ruled { border-top: 1.5px solid var(--hy-deep); border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--hy-deep); }
  table.ruled th { background: var(--hy-deep); color: #fff; border-bottom: none; }
  th, td { padding: 4px 7px; text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; vertical-align: top; }
  th { font-weight: 700; }
  td:first-child, th:first-child { text-align: left; }
  tr + tr td { border-top: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line); }
  .up { color: var(--up); font-weight: 700; }
  .down { color: var(--down); font-weight: 700; }
  .note-col { text-align: left; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 11.5px; }
  .nowrap { white-space: nowrap; }

  .heatmap { position: relative; height: 260px; margin-top: 5px; }
  .heat-box {
    position: absolute;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    padding: 3px 5px; text-align: center; overflow: hidden;
    outline: 1px solid var(--paper);
  }
  .heat-box .hname { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; max-width: 100%; }
  .heat-box .hpct { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .heat-box .htop { font-size: 8.8px; opacity: 0.9; margin-top: 1px; max-width: 100%; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; }
  .heat-up-3 { background: var(--heat-up-3); color: var(--heat-up-3-fg); }
  .heat-up-2 { background: var(--heat-up-2); color: var(--heat-up-2-fg); }
  .heat-up-1 { background: var(--heat-up-1); color: var(--heat-up-1-fg); }
  .heat-flat { background: var(--heat-flat); color: var(--heat-flat-fg); }
  .heat-down-1 { background: var(--heat-down-1); color: var(--heat-down-1-fg); }
  .heat-down-2 { background: var(--heat-down-2); color: var(--heat-down-2-fg); }
  .heat-down-3 { background: var(--heat-down-3); color: var(--heat-down-3-fg); }

  .heat-legend { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); margin: 6px 0 4px 0; }
  .heat-legend .bar {
    flex: 1; height: 7px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--heat-down-3), var(--heat-down-1), var(--heat-flat), var(--heat-up-1), var(--heat-up-3));
  }
  .sector-source { font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); text-align: right; margin-bottom: 4px; }

  .pill-strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
  .pill-neutral { color: var(--ink-faint); font-weight: 700; }
  .pill-weak { color: var(--down); font-weight: 700; }

  .cal-grid { display: grid; gap: 0; border: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line); margin-top: 5px; }
  .cal-day { border-left: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .cal-day:first-child { border-left: none; }
  .cal-head {
    background: var(--hy-deep); color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 4px 2px;
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }
  .cal-head .dow { font-size: 9px; font-weight: 300; opacity: 0.85; margin-left: 3px; }
  .cal-body { padding: 5px 6px; flex: 1; }
  .cal-event { margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .cal-event:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .cal-event .etitle { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.35; }
  .cal-event .etime { color: var(--hy-mid); font-weight: 700; }
  .cal-event .estars { color: var(--hy-mid); letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
  .cal-event .enote { font-size: 9px; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.35; margin-top: 1px; }
  .cal-foot {
    font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--hy-deep); text-align: center;
    padding: 3px 4px; border-top: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line); background: var(--hy-tint);
  }
  .cal-next {
    border: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line); border-top: none; background: var(--hy-tint);
    padding: 5px 10px; font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .cal-next b { color: var(--ink); }

  .compliance { margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 6px; border-top: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line); }
  .compliance p { font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }

  .footer { margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 5px; border-top: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line); }
  .footer .disclaimer { font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); text-align: center; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="masthead">
  <img src="{{ logo_compact }}" alt="한양증권">
  <div class="wrap-label">DAILY MARKET WRAP · {{ branch_name }}</div>
</div>

<div class="page">

  <div class="eyebrow-tag">{{ eyebrow }}</div>

  <div class="title-row">
    <div class="title-main">
      <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
      <div class="subtitle">{{ subtitle }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="byline-box">
      <div class="who">{{ branch_name }} {{ department }}</div>
      <div class="author">{{ author }}</div>
      <div>{{ contact }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Ⅰ. 지수 · 시장 지표 <span class="h2-note">국내 지수·환율은 {{ date_short }} 종가(한국거래소) · 금·유가는 {{ date_short }} 장중 시세</span></h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="ruled">
    <tr><th>구분</th><th>종가</th><th>전일비</th><th>등락률</th><th class="note-col">해석</th></tr>
    {% for i in indicators -%}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ i.label }}</td>
      <td>{{ i.close }}</td>
      <td class="{{ i.trend_class }}">{{ i.change_pt }}</td>
      <td class="{{ i.trend_class }}">{{ i.change_pct }}</td>
      <td class="note-col">{{ i.note }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </table></div>

  <h2>Ⅱ. 업종 동향 맵 <span class="h2-note">박스 크기 = 업종 시가총액 비중, 색·수치 = 해당 업종 대표종목 등락률 ({{ date_short }} 종가 기준)</span></h2>
  <div class="heatmap">
    {% for s in sectors -%}
    <div class="heat-box {{ s.heat_class }}" style="left:{{ s.x_pct }}%; top:{{ s.y_pct }}%; width:{{ s.w_pct }}%; height:{{ s.h_pct }}%;">
      <div class="hname">{{ s.name }}</div>
      <div class="hpct">{{ s.change_pct }}%</div>
      {% if not s.compact and s.top_stock %}
      <div class="htop">{{ s.top_stock }}</div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="heat-legend"><span>-3%</span><div class="bar"></div><span>+3%</span></div>
  <div class="sector-source">자료: KRX, 언론 보도 종합 / 한양증권 {{ branch_name }} 재구성</div>

  <h2>Ⅲ. 이슈 종목 — 왜 움직였고, 이어질 것인가</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="ruled">
    <tr><th class="nowrap">종목</th><th class="nowrap">등락률</th><th class="note-col">움직인 이유 (뉴스·수급·실적)</th><th class="nowrap">지속성</th><th class="note-col">언제·무엇을 확인</th></tr>
    {% for s in issue_stocks -%}
    <tr>
      <td class="nowrap">{{ s.name }}</td>
      <td class="{{ s.trend_class }} nowrap">{{ s.trend_symbol }} {{ s.change_pct }}%</td>
      <td class="note-col">{{ s.reason }}</td>
      <td class="{{ s.persistence_class }} nowrap">{{ s.persistence }}</td>
      <td class="note-col">{{ s.checkpoint }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </table></div>

  <h2>Ⅳ. 이번 주 캘린더 <span class="h2-note">시각은 한국시간(KST) · ★★★ = 지수 방향을 바꿀 수 있는 이벤트</span></h2>
  <div class="cal-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat({{ calendar.days|length }}, 1fr);">
    {% for d in calendar.days -%}
    <div class="cal-day">
      <div class="cal-head">{{ d.date }} <span class="dow">{{ d.dow }}</span></div>
      <div class="cal-body">
        {% for e in d.events -%}
        <div class="cal-event">
          <div class="etitle"><span class="etime">{{ e.time }}</span>{% if e.stars %} <span class="estars">{{ e.stars }}</span>{% endif %} {{ e.title }}</div>
          {% if e.note %}<div class="enote">{{ e.note }}</div>{% endif %}
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% if d.footer %}<div class="cal-foot">{{ d.footer }}</div>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% if calendar.next_week %}
  <div class="cal-next"><b>다음 주 예고</b> &nbsp;{{ calendar.next_week }}</div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="compliance">
    <p>본 자료는 당사 지점 고객 및 임직원의 참고용으로 작성된 것으로 투자권유 또는 투자자문 목적이 아니며, 기재된 수치·전망은 오차가 발생할 수 있습니다. 투자의 최종 판단과 책임은 투자자 본인에게 있습니다. 당사 허락 없이 복사·대여·배포될 수 없습니다.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <div class="disclaimer">DAILY MARKET WRAP · {{ branch_name }}</div>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
